-toc-link ez-toc-heading-4" href="#Does_White_Sesame_Seed_Oil_Last_Longer_Than_Black_Sesame_Seed_Oil" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_9" data-source="" data-orig="Does White Sesame Seed Oil Last Longer Than Black Sesame Seed Oil">Does White Sesame Seed Oil Last Longer Than Black Sesame Seed Oil</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-5" href="#How_to_Tell_if_Your_Sesame_Seed_Oil_Has_Gone_Bad" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_10" data-source="" data-orig="How to Tell if Your Sesame Seed Oil Has Gone Bad">How to Tell if Your Sesame Seed Oil Has Gone Bad</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-6" href="#What_Does_Spoiled_Sesame_Seed_Oil_Look_Like" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_11" data-source="" data-orig="What Does Spoiled Sesame Seed Oil Look Like">What Does Spoiled Sesame Seed Oil Look Like</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-7" href="#Can_You_Eat_Sesame_Seed_Oil_After_It_Has_Gone_Bad" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_12" data-source="" data-orig="Can You Eat Sesame Seed Oil After It Has Gone Bad">Can You Eat Sesame Seed Oil After It Has Gone Bad</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-8" href="#Which_Oil_is_More_Prone_to_Spoilage" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_13" data-source="" data-orig="Which Oil is More Prone to Spoilage">Which Oil is More Prone to Spoilage</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-9" href="#Reference" >Referencia</a></li></ul></nav></div><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Does_Sesame_Seed_Oil_Go_Bad"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_14" data-source="" data-orig="Does Sesame Seed Oil Go Bad">Does Sesame Seed Oil Go Bad</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p>Sí, <a href="/es/product-category/sesame-series/"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_15" data-source="" data-orig="sesame seed oil">sesame seed oil</span></a> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_16" data-source="" data-orig="can spoil">can spoil</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_17" data-source="" data-orig="It is susceptible to temperature">It is susceptible to temperature</span>, luz, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_18" data-source="" data-orig="and oxygen">and oxygen</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_19" data-source="" data-orig="which can lead to oxidation and rancidity">which can lead to oxidation and rancidity</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_20" data-source="" data-orig="The process of spoilage is gradual and may not be noticeable initially">The process of spoilage is gradual and may not be noticeable initially</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_21" data-source="" data-orig="but the quality will decline over time">but the quality will decline over time</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_22" data-source="" data-orig="Rancid sesame seed oil may develop a strong">Rancid sesame seed oil may develop a strong</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_23" data-source="" data-orig="unpleasant odor due to the breakdown of fats">unpleasant odor due to the breakdown of fats</span>. Además, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_24" data-source="" data-orig="it can become cloudy">it can become cloudy</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_25" data-source="" data-orig="develop sediment">develop sediment</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_26" data-source="" data-orig="or emit off-odors">or emit off-odors</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_27" data-source="" data-orig="such as sour or rotten smells">such as sour or rotten smells</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_28" data-source="" data-orig="To prevent spoilage">To prevent spoilage</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_29" data-source="" data-orig="it is advisable to store sesame seed oil properly">it is advisable to store sesame seed oil properly</span>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_30" data-source="" data-orig="keep it away from light">keep it away from light</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_31" data-source="" data-orig="store it in a cool place">store it in a cool place</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_32" data-source="" data-orig="seal it tightly">seal it tightly</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_33" data-source="" data-orig="and use it within a short period">and use it within a short period</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_Long_Can_Sesame_Seed_Oil_Be_Stored"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_34" data-source="" data-orig="How Long Can Sesame Seed Oil Be Stored">How Long Can Sesame Seed Oil Be Stored</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_35" data-source="" data-orig="The shelf life of sesame seed oil is generally about">The shelf life of sesame seed oil is generally about</span> 18 meses. Sin embargo, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_36" data-source="" data-orig="if stored at room temperature">if stored at room temperature</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_37" data-source="" data-orig="it’s recommended to use it within">it’s recommended to use it within</span> 12 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_38" data-source="" data-orig="months due to its susceptibility to oxidation">months due to its susceptibility to oxidation</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_39" data-source="" data-orig="If refrigerated">If refrigerated</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_40" data-source="" data-orig="sesame seed oil can last over two years">sesame seed oil can last over two years</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_41" data-source="" data-orig="Even under refrigeration">Even under refrigeration</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_42" data-source="" data-orig="it&#8217;s best to use it within the shelf life to avoid unpleasant odors or toxic substances due to oxidation">it&#8217;s best to use it within the shelf life to avoid unpleasant odors or toxic substances due to oxidation</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_43" data-source="" data-orig="To ensure safety and quality">To ensure safety and quality</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_44" data-source="" data-orig="it&#8217;s advisable to consume sesame seed oil promptly within its shelf life">it&#8217;s advisable to consume sesame seed oil promptly within its shelf life</span>.</p><figure id="attachment_577-2" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-577-2" style="width: 721px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><img src="/images/Does-Sesame-Seed-Oil-Go-Bad--300x188.jpg" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-577" alt="Does Sesame Seed Oil Go Bad" width="731" height="458" title="Does Sesame Seed Oil Go Bad? How to Store It ? 7 Tips 5" /><figcaption id="caption-attachment-577-2" class="wp-caption-text"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_45" data-source="" data-orig="Does Sesame Seed Oil Go Bad">Does Sesame Seed Oil Go Bad</span></figcaption></figure><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_to_Properly_Store_Sesame_Seed_Oil"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_46" data-source="" data-orig="How to Properly Store Sesame Seed Oil">How to Properly Store Sesame Seed Oil</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_47" data-source="" data-orig="Proper storage methods for sesame seed oil include">Proper storage methods for sesame seed oil include</span>:</p><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_48" data-source="" data-orig="Avoid light">Avoid light</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_49" data-source="" data-orig="Unsaturated fatty acids in sesame seed oil can oxidize under light">Unsaturated fatty acids in sesame seed oil can oxidize under light</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_50" data-source="" data-orig="reducing quality">reducing quality</span>. Guárdelo en una fresca, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_51" data-source="" data-orig="dark place away from direct sunlight">dark place away from direct sunlight</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_52" data-source="" data-orig="Store in a cool environment">Store in a cool environment</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_53" data-source="" data-orig="High temperatures can deplete the oil&#8217;s natural antioxidants and increase spoilage risk">High temperatures can deplete the oil&#8217;s natural antioxidants and increase spoilage risk</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_54" data-source="" data-orig="Storing in a refrigerator is recommended to extend shelf life">Storing in a refrigerator is recommended to extend shelf life</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_55" data-source="" data-orig="Use a sealed container">Use a sealed container</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_56" data-source="" data-orig="A well-sealed container can prevent air exposure and reduce oxidation">A well-sealed container can prevent air exposure and reduce oxidation</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_57" data-source="" data-orig="Glass bottles are a good option as rubber stoppers can impart off-flavors">Glass bottles are a good option as rubber stoppers can impart off-flavors</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_58" data-source="" data-orig="Keep dry">Keep dry</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_59" data-source="" data-orig="Maintain a dry storage environment to avoid moisture entering the oil">Maintain a dry storage environment to avoid moisture entering the oil</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_60" data-source="" data-orig="which accelerates oxidation">which accelerates oxidation</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_61" data-source="" data-orig="Prefer small packages">Prefer small packages</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_62" data-source="" data-orig="Buying smaller quantities can help ensure the oil is used quickly">Buying smaller quantities can help ensure the oil is used quickly</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_63" data-source="" data-orig="minimizing oxidation chances">minimizing oxidation chances</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_64" data-source="" data-orig="Avoid heat sources">Avoid heat sources</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_65" data-source="" data-orig="Keep it away from stoves and heaters to prevent accelerated oxidation from high temperatures">Keep it away from stoves and heaters to prevent accelerated oxidation from high temperatures</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_66" data-source="" data-orig="Refrigerate">Refrigerate</span> (opcional):</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_67" data-source="" data-orig="While not necessary">While not necessary</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_68" data-source="" data-orig="some choose to refrigerate sesame seed oil to extend its shelf life">some choose to refrigerate sesame seed oil to extend its shelf life</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_69" data-source="" data-orig="Note that refrigeration may cause the oil to crystallize">Note that refrigeration may cause the oil to crystallize</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_70" data-source="" data-orig="affecting texture">affecting texture</span>.</li></ul><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_71" data-source="" data-orig="By following these methods">By following these methods</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_72" data-source="" data-orig="you can effectively extend the shelf life of sesame seed oil while maintaining its best flavor and nutritional value">you can effectively extend the shelf life of sesame seed oil while maintaining its best flavor and nutritional value</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Does_White_Sesame_Seed_Oil_Last_Longer_Than_Black_Sesame_Seed_Oil"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_73" data-source="" data-orig="Does White Sesame Seed Oil Last Longer Than Black Sesame Seed Oil">Does White Sesame Seed Oil Last Longer Than Black Sesame Seed Oil</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_74" data-source="" data-orig="White and black sesame seed oils have similar shelf lives at room temperature">White and black sesame seed oils have similar shelf lives at room temperature</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_75" data-source="" data-orig="typically around one year">typically around one year</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_76" data-source="" data-orig="If refrigerated">If refrigerated</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_77" data-source="" data-orig="their shelf life can extend to two years">their shelf life can extend to two years</span>. Por lo tanto, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_78" data-source="" data-orig="both types can last significantly longer with proper storage">both types can last significantly longer with proper storage</span>. Además, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_79" data-source="" data-orig="the antioxidant properties of sesamin suggest that sesame seed oil is less prone to oxidation at room temperature">the antioxidant properties of sesamin suggest that sesame seed oil is less prone to oxidation at room temperature</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_80" data-source="" data-orig="which may explain why commercial sesame seed oils rarely display expiration dates">which may explain why commercial sesame seed oils rarely display expiration dates</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_to_Tell_if_Your_Sesame_Seed_Oil_Has_Gone_Bad"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_81" data-source="" data-orig="How to Tell if Your Sesame Seed Oil Has Gone Bad">How to Tell if Your Sesame Seed Oil Has Gone Bad</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><figure id="attachment_578-2" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-578-2" style="width: 703px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><img src="/images/Do-Sesame-Seeds-Oil-Go-Bad-300x192.jpg" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-578" alt="Does Sesame Seed Oil Go Bad" width="713" height="456" title="Does Sesame Seed Oil Go Bad? How to Store It ? 7 Tips 6" /><figcaption id="caption-attachment-578-2" class="wp-caption-text"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_82" data-source="" data-orig="Does Sesame Seed Oil Go Bad">Does Sesame Seed Oil Go Bad</span></figcaption></figure><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_83" data-source="" data-orig="To determine if sesame seed oil has spoiled">To determine if sesame seed oil has spoiled</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_84" data-source="" data-orig="consider the following">consider the following</span>:</p><ul><li><strong>Oler:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_85" data-source="" data-orig="Fresh sesame seed oil should have a distinct aroma">Fresh sesame seed oil should have a distinct aroma</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_86" data-source="" data-orig="If you detect sour">If you detect sour</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_87" data-source="" data-orig="moldy">moldy</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_88" data-source="" data-orig="or unusual smells">or unusual smells</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_89" data-source="" data-orig="like spicy or rancid odors">like spicy or rancid odors</span>), <span class ="tr_" id="tr_90" data-source="" data-orig="the oil may be spoiled and should not be consumed">the oil may be spoiled and should not be consumed</span>.</li><li><strong>Color:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_91" data-source="" data-orig="Fresh sesame seed oil is typically pale yellow or golden and clear">Fresh sesame seed oil is typically pale yellow or golden and clear</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_92" data-source="" data-orig="If the color becomes cloudy">If the color becomes cloudy</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_93" data-source="" data-orig="dark red">dark red</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_94" data-source="" data-orig="or deep amber">or deep amber</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_95" data-source="" data-orig="or if sediment appears">or if sediment appears</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_96" data-source="" data-orig="it is likely spoiled">it is likely spoiled</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_97" data-source="" data-orig="Clarity">Clarity</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_98" data-source="" data-orig="Tilt the bottle to check if the oil is clear">Tilt the bottle to check if the oil is clear</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_99" data-source="" data-orig="Cloudiness or suspended particles indicate spoilage">Cloudiness or suspended particles indicate spoilage</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_100" data-source="" data-orig="Storage conditions">Storage conditions</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_101" data-source="" data-orig="Sesame seed oil should be used quickly after opening">Sesame seed oil should be used quickly after opening</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_102" data-source="" data-orig="ideally within">ideally within</span> 1-2 meses. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_103" data-source="" data-orig="Avoid exposing it to high temperatures or bright light">Avoid exposing it to high temperatures or bright light</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_104" data-source="" data-orig="as these conditions accelerate oxidation">as these conditions accelerate oxidation</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_105" data-source="" data-orig="leading to spoilage">leading to spoilage</span>.</li></ul><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_106" data-source="" data-orig="Using these methods">Using these methods</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_107" data-source="" data-orig="you can accurately determine whether sesame seed oil has gone bad">you can accurately determine whether sesame seed oil has gone bad</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_108" data-source="" data-orig="ensuring safe consumption">ensuring safe consumption</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_Does_Spoiled_Sesame_Seed_Oil_Look_Like"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_109" data-source="" data-orig="What Does Spoiled Sesame Seed Oil Look Like">What Does Spoiled Sesame Seed Oil Look Like</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_110" data-source="" data-orig="Spoiled sesame seed oil typically exhibits the following characteristics">Spoiled sesame seed oil typically exhibits the following characteristics</span>:</p><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_111" data-source="" data-orig="Color change">Color change</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_112" data-source="" data-orig="Fresh sesame seed oil is golden yellow">Fresh sesame seed oil is golden yellow</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_113" data-source="" data-orig="If it becomes darker or cloudy">If it becomes darker or cloudy</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_114" data-source="" data-orig="it may be spoiled">it may be spoiled</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_115" data-source="" data-orig="Odor change">Odor change</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_116" data-source="" data-orig="Fresh sesame seed oil has a strong sesame aroma">Fresh sesame seed oil has a strong sesame aroma</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_117" data-source="" data-orig="If it develops off-odors like sourness">If it develops off-odors like sourness</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_118" data-source="" data-orig="rancidity">rancidity</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_119" data-source="" data-orig="or a peculiar irritating smell">or a peculiar irritating smell</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_120" data-source="" data-orig="like a">like a</span> &#8220;<span class ="tr_" id="tr_121" data-source="" data-orig="rancid">rancid</span>&#8221; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_122" data-source="" data-orig="odor">odor</span>), <span class ="tr_" id="tr_123" data-source="" data-orig="it indicates oxidation and the formation of harmful substances">it indicates oxidation and the formation of harmful substances</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_124" data-source="" data-orig="making it unsafe to consume">making it unsafe to consume</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_125" data-source="" data-orig="Taste change">Taste change</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_126" data-source="" data-orig="Fresh sesame seed oil has a smooth texture">Fresh sesame seed oil has a smooth texture</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_127" data-source="" data-orig="If it tastes sour">If it tastes sour</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_128" data-source="" data-orig="bitter">bitter</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_129" data-source="" data-orig="or burnt">or burnt</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_130" data-source="" data-orig="these are signs of spoilage">these are signs of spoilage</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_131" data-source="" data-orig="Appearance change">Appearance change</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_132" data-source="" data-orig="Quality sesame seed oil should be clear and transparent">Quality sesame seed oil should be clear and transparent</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_133" data-source="" data-orig="without sediment or floating particles">without sediment or floating particles</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_134" data-source="" data-orig="Cloudiness or sediment indicates spoilage">Cloudiness or sediment indicates spoilage</span>.</li></ul><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_135" data-source="" data-orig="To assess whether sesame seed oil has spoiled">To assess whether sesame seed oil has spoiled</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_136" data-source="" data-orig="consider its color">consider its color</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_137" data-source="" data-orig="odor">odor</span>, gusto, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_138" data-source="" data-orig="and appearance">and appearance</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_139" data-source="" data-orig="If any of these changes are observed">If any of these changes are observed</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_140" data-source="" data-orig="it&#8217;s best not to consume it to avoid potential health risks">it&#8217;s best not to consume it to avoid potential health risks</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Can_You_Eat_Sesame_Seed_Oil_After_It_Has_Gone_Bad"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_141" data-source="" data-orig="Can You Eat Sesame Seed Oil After It Has Gone Bad">Can You Eat Sesame Seed Oil After It Has Gone Bad</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><figure id="attachment_579-2" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-579-2" style="width: 688px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><img src="/images/Does-Sesame-Seed-Oil-Go-Bad-300x187.jpg" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-579" alt="Does Sesame Seed Oil Go Bad" width="698" height="435" title="Does Sesame Seed Oil Go Bad? How to Store It ? 7 Tips 7" /><figcaption id="caption-attachment-579-2" class="wp-caption-text"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_142" data-source="" data-orig="Does Sesame Seed Oil Go Bad">Does Sesame Seed Oil Go Bad</span></figcaption></figure><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_143" data-source="" data-orig="It is not advisable to consume spoiled sesame seed oil">It is not advisable to consume spoiled sesame seed oil</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_144" data-source="" data-orig="Spoilage leads to the production of harmful substances like peroxides and free radicals">Spoilage leads to the production of harmful substances like peroxides and free radicals</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_145" data-source="" data-orig="which can pose health risks">which can pose health risks</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_146" data-source="" data-orig="potentially leading to cardiovascular diseases">potentially leading to cardiovascular diseases</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_147" data-source="" data-orig="Alzheimer’s">Alzheimer’s</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_148" data-source="" data-orig="Parkinson’s">Parkinson’s</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_149" data-source="" data-orig="and other health issues">and other health issues</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_150" data-source="" data-orig="Eating spoiled oil may cause gastrointestinal discomfort">Eating spoiled oil may cause gastrointestinal discomfort</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_151" data-source="" data-orig="nausea">nausea</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_152" data-source="" data-orig="vomiting">vomiting</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_153" data-source="" data-orig="severe abdominal pain">severe abdominal pain</span>, y, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_154" data-source="" data-orig="in serious cases">in serious cases</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_155" data-source="" data-orig="dehydration and liver damage">dehydration and liver damage</span>.</p><p>Además, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_156" data-source="" data-orig="sesame seed oil has a shelf life of about">sesame seed oil has a shelf life of about</span> 18 meses, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_157" data-source="" data-orig="and it should not exceed">and it should not exceed</span> 12 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_158" data-source="" data-orig="months at room temperature">months at room temperature</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_159" data-source="" data-orig="Even when refrigerated">Even when refrigerated</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_160" data-source="" data-orig="it is not recommended to keep it for more than two years">it is not recommended to keep it for more than two years</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_161" data-source="" data-orig="If sesame seed oil develops off-odors">If sesame seed oil develops off-odors</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_162" data-source="" data-orig="like a rancid smell">like a rancid smell</span>), <span class ="tr_" id="tr_163" data-source="" data-orig="it indicates spoilage">it indicates spoilage</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_164" data-source="" data-orig="and it should not be consumed">and it should not be consumed</span>. Por lo tanto, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_165" data-source="" data-orig="for health safety">for health safety</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_166" data-source="" data-orig="avoid eating expired or spoiled sesame seed oil">avoid eating expired or spoiled sesame seed oil</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Which_Oil_is_More_Prone_to_Spoilage"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_167" data-source="" data-orig="Which Oil is More Prone to Spoilage">Which Oil is More Prone to Spoilage</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_168" data-source="" data-orig="Peanut oil">Peanut oil</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_169" data-source="" data-orig="It contains a high amount of unsaturated fatty acids">It contains a high amount of unsaturated fatty acids</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_170" data-source="" data-orig="which are prone to breaking down at high temperatures">which are prone to breaking down at high temperatures</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_171" data-source="" data-orig="Peanut oil has a high peroxide value">Peanut oil has a high peroxide value</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_172" data-source="" data-orig="meaning it oxidizes quickly">meaning it oxidizes quickly</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_173" data-source="" data-orig="leading to rancidity">leading to rancidity</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_174" data-source="" data-orig="During storage">During storage</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_175" data-source="" data-orig="its acidity and peroxide values can significantly increase">its acidity and peroxide values can significantly increase</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_176" data-source="" data-orig="raising the risk of spoilage">raising the risk of spoilage</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_177" data-source="" data-orig="Olive oil">Olive oil</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_178" data-source="" data-orig="With lower levels of polyunsaturated fatty acids">With lower levels of polyunsaturated fatty acids</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_179" data-source="" data-orig="olive oil has better oxidative stability and is less prone to spoilage">olive oil has better oxidative stability and is less prone to spoilage</span>. Sin embargo, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_180" data-source="" data-orig="high temperatures or improper storage can still accelerate spoilage">high temperatures or improper storage can still accelerate spoilage</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_181" data-source="" data-orig="Butter">Butter</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_182" data-source="" data-orig="As a high-fat dairy product">As a high-fat dairy product</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_183" data-source="" data-orig="butter can soften and spoil quickly at room temperature">butter can soften and spoil quickly at room temperature</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_184" data-source="" data-orig="typically within">typically within</span> 2-3 días. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_185" data-source="" data-orig="Refrigeration can extend its shelf life">Refrigeration can extend its shelf life</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_186" data-source="" data-orig="but freezing is more effective">but freezing is more effective</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_187" data-source="" data-orig="Canola oil">Canola oil</span>:</strong> Con 32% <span class ="tr_" id="tr_188" data-source="" data-orig="polyunsaturated fatty acids">polyunsaturated fatty acids</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_189" data-source="" data-orig="canola oil is less likely to have a high peroxide value but can still oxidize and spoil">canola oil is less likely to have a high peroxide value but can still oxidize and spoil</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_190" data-source="" data-orig="It’s recommended to use it within">It’s recommended to use it within</span> 3-6 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_191" data-source="" data-orig="months after opening">months after opening</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_192" data-source="" data-orig="as exposure to air accelerates oxidation">as exposure to air accelerates oxidation</span>.</li></ul><p>En general, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_193" data-source="" data-orig="peanut oil is more prone to oxidation and spoilage due to its high content of unsaturated fatty acids compared to other oils">peanut oil is more prone to oxidation and spoilage due to its high content of unsaturated fatty acids compared to other oils</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Reference"></span>Referencia<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_194" data-source="" data-orig="Research on the Antioxidant Effects of Several Natural Antioxidants on Sesame Seed Oil">Research on the Antioxidant Effects of Several Natural Antioxidants on Sesame Seed Oil</span></strong>. (Dakota del Norte.). <em><span class ="tr_" id="tr_195" data-source="" data-orig="Journal Title">Journal Title</span></em>.</p><p><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_196" data-source="" data-orig="Guide to Selecting">Guide to Selecting</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_197" data-source="" data-orig="Consuming">Consuming</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_198" data-source="" data-orig="and Storing Sesame Seed Oil">and Storing Sesame Seed Oil</span></strong>. (Dakota del Norte.). <em><span class ="tr_" id="tr_199" data-source="" data-orig="Journal Title">Journal Title</span></em>.</p><p><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_200" data-source="" data-orig="How to Eat Safely">How to Eat Safely</span>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_201" data-source="" data-orig="Food Safety Consumption Tips">Food Safety Consumption Tips</span></strong>. (Dakota del Norte.). <em><span class ="tr_" id="tr_202" data-source="" data-orig="Journal Title">Journal Title</span></em>.</p><p><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_203" data-source="" data-orig="Knowledge and Precautions for Selecting Vegetable Oils">Knowledge and Precautions for Selecting Vegetable Oils</span></strong>. (Dakota del Norte.). <span class ="tr_" id="tr_204" data-source="" data-orig="National Food and Material Reserve Bureau">National Food and Material Reserve Bureau</span>.</p><p><em><span class ="tr_" id="tr_205" data-source="" data-orig="Chemmuniqué">Chemmuniqué</span></em>. (Dakota del Norte.). <em><span class ="tr_" id="tr_206" data-source="" data-orig="Publisher/Organization">Publisher/Organization</span></em>.</p><p><em><span class ="tr_" id="tr_207" data-source="" data-orig="Healthy Crispy Food">Healthy Crispy Food</span></em>. (Dakota del Norte.). <em><span class ="tr_" id="tr_208" data-source="" data-orig="Publisher/Organization">Publisher/Org